<mxfile host="app.diagrams.net">
  <diagram name="Страница-1" id="NJYX5I6_rkLx3GFBXxpG">
    <mxGraphModel dx="1030" dy="527" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="827" pageHeight="1169" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <UserObject label="" plantUmlData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;@startuml\n&#39; Отключаем иконки для строгого стиля\nskinparam classAttributeIconSize 0\n\n&#39; ГЛАВНАЯ НАСТРОЙКА ДЛЯ УГЛОВ 90 ГРАДУСОВ:\nskinparam linetype ortho\n\n&#39; Увеличиваем отступы, чтобы линиям было где пройти ровно\nskinparam nodesep 80\nskinparam ranksep 80\n\nclass User {\n  + id: UUID\n  - email: String\n  - passwordHash: String\n  - role: Enum\n  + login(): Boolean\n  + getProfile(): User\n}\n\nclass Administrator {\n  + createTemplate(): TaskTemplate\n  + manageProduct(): void\n  + viewTransactions(): List&lt;Transaction&gt;\n}\n\nclass Employee {\n  - balance: Int\n  + createTask(template: TaskTemplate): Task\n  + takeTask(task: Task): void\n  + approveTask(task: Task): void\n  + buyProduct(product: Product): void\n}\n\nclass TaskTemplate {\n  - id: UUID\n  - title: String\n  - defaultReward: Int\n}\n\nclass Task {\n  - id: UUID\n  - title: String\n  - reward: Int\n  - status: Enum\n  - creatorId: UUID\n  - executorId: UUID\n  + changeStatus(): void\n}\n\nclass Product {\n  - id: UUID\n  - name: String\n  - price: Int\n  - stockCount: Int\n  - imagePath: String\n  + decreaseStock(): void\n}\n\nclass Transaction {\n  - id: UUID\n  - amount: Int\n  - type: Enum\n  - timestamp: DateTime\n  + process(): void\n}\n\n&#39; Наследование\nUser &lt;|-- Administrator\nUser &lt;|-- Employee\n\n&#39; Связи Админа (строго вниз)\nAdministrator ..&gt; TaskTemplate : &lt;&lt;create&gt;&gt;\nAdministrator ..&gt; Product : &lt;&lt;manage&gt;&gt;\n\n&#39; Связи Сотрудника (строго вниз)\nEmployee ..&gt; Product : &lt;&lt;buy&gt;&gt;\nEmployee \&quot;1\&quot; --&gt; \&quot;*\&quot; Task : &lt;&lt;create / execute&gt;&gt;\nEmployee \&quot;1\&quot; *-- \&quot;*\&quot; Transaction : history\n\n&#39; Связи между нижними сущностями\nTask .right.&gt; TaskTemplate : &lt;&lt;use&gt;&gt;\nTransaction .up.&gt; Task : &lt;&lt;link&gt;&gt;\nTransaction .up.&gt; Product : &lt;&lt;link&gt;&gt;\n\n@enduml&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;format&quot;: &quot;svg&quot;&#xa;}" id="J0meu-CKLW8hVTzhLs_F-2">
          <mxCell parent="1" style="shape=image;noLabel=1;verticalAlign=top;aspect=fixed;imageAspect=0;image=data:image/svg+xml,;" vertex="1">
            <mxGeometry height="790" width="715" x="20" y="250" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
</mxfile>
